<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2. </span>Performance comparison between baseline methods and our SVD-feature-based classifier across HaluEval subsets. SVD-GX indicates the group size X used to construct the matrix. Empty entries are due to constraints with memory when constructing tensors.
